      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARRY THE HAT (6) was without a win before he improved last start to score by 2.5 metres over 1780m at Redcliffe three weeks ago. Meets some better types this time but he has the ability to test this field. DOUBLEFAULT (9) was in the money at this track two runs ago before finishing sixth at his latest appearance over 1660m at this track, beaten 30 metres. This is a nice drop in grade so he is in the right race to return to form. UNJUST ENRICHMENT (2) is on the radar after his last-start fourth over 1609m at Newcastle a week-and-a-half ago. IMASILLYBILLY (1) is a two-year-old colt by American Ideal from Indigenous Art on debut. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Was not far away in a recent trial. Well-placed to score at his first appearance.",
